    "intro_html":  "Lasagna soup is what happens when somebody admits out loud that layering a lasagna is the least fun part of making one. Same flavors, same ricotta and parmesan, none of the assembly. It is a one pot dinner that hits \u003cstrong\u003e562 calories and 41 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e a bowl for about \u003cstrong\u003e$4.01\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost), and it freezes better than an actual lasagna does.",
